From: JPyke3 <github@pyk.ee>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: rg55g1: correct touch orientation

The RG55G1 digitizer reports both axes opposite to the displayed panel.
Invert X and Y so touch coordinates match the screen.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm4450-anbernic-rg55g1.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm4450-anbernic-rg55g1.dts
@@ -2053,0 +2054,2 @@
+			touchscreen-inverted-x;
+			touchscreen-inverted-y;
